node_modules
.ana/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.runs.example
/CLAUDE.md
__pycache__/
# A test fixture's scratch inside the checkout, at any depth (v1's tests named theirs this way).
**/.ana-scratch-*/
# The wall probe's canary folder, which the probe removes and a killed process may leave
# (`probeWall`, `src/tools/command.ts`).
/.ana-wall-probe-*/
# The archive of campaigns that left their worktrees, and of copies from other hosts
# (`ARCHIVE`, `tools/runs/registry.ts`). Their logs hold hidden values: they stay on the exam side.
/data/runs/
# What each campaign hands over at its end, its harness whole with its programs, the public rules and
# its closing report (`harnessesOf`, `tools/runs/registry.ts`). No hidden value, but large.
/data/harnesses/
# Every deterministic reader's output over each campaign's log, one folder a campaign, replaced whole
# when its log moves (`derivedOf`, `tools/wri/derive.ts`). The readers print hidden values: exam side.
/data/derived/
# The suite's recorded file timings: each checkout learns its own order from its first run
# (`tools/runtime/test-suite.ts`).
/test/.test-timings.json
# Every study's clones of the systems it compares against, with the benchmarks they download and
# the benchmark's raw job folders, in one folder (`studies/README.md`). The run records a study
# keeps, under studies/runs/, are tracked.
/studies/external/
# v1's local state, which a checkout of this repository from before 11 October 2026 still holds
# on disk: run outputs, Builder-written domains, operator notes, runtime pins and the UI build.
# v2 reads none of it.
/campaigns/
/domains/
/runs/
/notes/
/.harness/
/.scratch/
/packages/ui/dist/
/packages/ui/.token
# Skills and other files set aside on this machine instead of shipped, such as a zipped skill a
# pull request once carried (30 October 2026).
/.archive/
# Claude Code's own state in a checkout: a person's local settings, its worktrees, schedules,
# checkpoints and agent memory. The shared settings, `.claude/settings.json`, stay tracked.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.*
/.claude/checkpoints/
/.claude/agent-memory-local/
# A checkout's own working notes on where its work stands, kept beside the tracked plan
# (`docs/plan.md` stays the status of record).
/docs/progress/
